  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759228,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1001 Letter for Commodore 64: A Whirlwind of Alphabetical Fun!\n\nStep right up and join the Muppets for a delightful learning adventure in *1001 Letter*! This charming Commodore 64 game transforms letter recognition and early spelling into a joyous, timeless experience. Inspired by the beloved Letter-Go-Round from Sesame Street, young players (ages 3-4) are invited to spin along with Elmo, Cookie Monster, and friends.\n\nThe gameplay revolves around a whimsical ferris wheel, where letters appear in buckets as it turns. Players must match these letters – in upper case, lower case, or a mix – or use them to spell simple words and complete puzzles. Challenges include identifying missing letters and uncovering secret words. There's no rush; players can take their time and experiment with each letter. \n\nSuccessful matches and completed words are rewarded with lively Muppet celebrations and encouragement, making learning a truly rewarding experience. *1001 Letter* is a perfect introduction to literacy, blending education and entertainment in a vibrant, unforgettable package."
    },
